#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *General Formulation of Quantum Information,* the third course in the *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* series comprising the following courses:\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke *Formulasi Umum Maklumat Kuantum,* kursus ketiga dalam siri *Memahami Maklumat dan Pengiraan Kuantum* yang terdiri daripada kursus-kursus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Asas maklumat kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fundamentals of quantum algorithms](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"
msgstr "[Asas-asas algoritma kuantum](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "General formulation of quantum information (this course)\n"
msgstr "Formulasi umum maklumat kuantum (kursus ini)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Foundations of quantum error correction](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"
msgstr "[Asas pembetulan ralat kuantum](/learning/courses/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course describes the general formulation of quantum information, where quantum states are represented by *density matrices,*\n"
"changes in states are described by *channels,* and a more general class of *measurements* can be considered than those discussed in\n"
"*Basics of quantum information.* The course also discusses mathematical ways of formalizing the *distance* or *similarity* between\n"
"quantum states, and how they relate to channels and measurements in operational ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini menerangkan formulasi umum maklumat kuantum, di mana keadaan kuantum diwakili oleh *matriks ketumpatan,*\n"
"perubahan dalam keadaan diterangkan oleh *saluran,* dan kelas *pengukuran* yang lebih umum boleh dipertimbangkan berbanding yang dibincangkan dalam\n"
"*Asas maklumat kuantum.* Kursus ini juga membincangkan cara matematik untuk memformalkan *jarak* atau *kesamaan* antara\n"
"keadaan kuantum, dan bagaimana hubungannya dengan saluran dan pengukuran secara operasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, engineering, and\n"
"mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk pelajar, profesional, dan peminat dalam bidang seperti sains komputer, fizik, kejuruteraan, dan\n"
"matematik yang ingin mendapat pengetahuan tentang asas teori maklumat dan pengiraan kuantum.\n"

